
/*!
	add counter representing how many clients use an extension.

	unloading should happen per client close. the client loads, the counter goes up, the counter goes down on client close. if 0, unload.
*/

/*!
	implement a single malloc segment to "malloc" on.
*/

/*!
	max client amount?
*/

/*!
	add generations and other data to extensions, as well as the clients.
*/

/*!
	decouple the server from the transport, currently shm.
*/

/*!
	keep local copies of the extension struct so that we can forgo checking if functions are non-null.
